# Software industry mapping for PLM
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/plm/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:software_revision owl:equivalentClass sw:SoftwareRevision .
legacy:software_revision_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:softwareRevisionId .
legacy:release_engineering_change owl:equivalentClass sw:ReleaseEngineeringChange .
legacy:release_engineering_change_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:releaseEngineeringChangeId .
legacy:revises_software_revision rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:revisesSoftwareRevision .
